     "file": "PTP/Asymptotic.lean",
     "line": 183,
     "code": "/-- The PTP Toom–Cook exponent `log_k (3k - 2)`. -/\nnoncomputable def ptpExponent (k : ℕ) : ℝ := Real.logb (k : ℝ) (((3 * k - 2 : ℕ)) : ℝ)",
     "note": "The exponent \\(\\log_k(3k-2)\\)."
