     "code": "/-- **`plan_check` (PTP): every planner output passes `PTPPolicy.check`.** -/\ntheorem plan_check (tables : List PTPTable) (htab : ∀ T ∈ tables, T.contract = true) (n : Nat)\n    (o : Oracle tables) : (plan tables n o).check = true := …"
